meta {
  name: Get All Reminder
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/reminder
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Reminder

  This request is used to get all reminder, you can filter the reminder data using given `search` to find based on reminder_title or reminder_body. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, and a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Reminder fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "reminder fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "28668090-5653-dff5-2d8f-af603fc36b45",
          "reminder_title": "Routine service",
          "vehicle_plate_number": "D 1610 ZBC",
          "reminder_context": "Service",
          "reminder_body": "Lorem ipsum",
          "reminder_attachment": [
            {
              "attachment_type": "location",
              "attachment_value": "-6.223617982933017, 106.84620287273809"
            }
          ],
          "remind_at": "2025-06-24 10:54:42",
          "created_at": "2025-06-19 07:54:42"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — reminder failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "reminder history not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}